Workaround before this get merged:

```
import Toggle from 'react-instantsearch/src/components/Toggle'
import { connectToggle } from 'react-instantsearch/connectors'

const FixedToggle = (props) => {
  return (
    <Toggle                                                                        
      {...props}
      currentRefinement={props.checked}
    />
  ) 
}

const ConnectedFixedToggle = connectToggle(FixedToggle)
```

Then use `ConnectedFixedToggle` instead of `Toggle`.
